==Trivia==
*During the release of 13.1, [[Festival Cats: Lunar New Year's]] changed from dropping the old (11.2) [[Legendary Charm]] to the new one (13.1), when the international versions are using the old Legendary Charm for the 2024 [[Lunar New Year (Event Gacha)|Lunar New Year]] Event Gacha, players of English and Korean versions who have updated their game from 13.0 to 13.1 during the ongoing 2024 Lunar New Year event could not use their new rewards in the event gacha.
**This issue later got fixed in the Version 13.1.1 update.

